SHEPHERD-VITA device kit #10, track aot: the kit #10 AOT compiler rows (vita/notes/kit10-aot.md) -- AOT that learns from play
(SHEPHERD_AOT_LEARNED / SHEPHERD_AOT_LEARNED_IMAGE), cold code for size (SHEPHERD_AOT_COLD / _COLD_MODE / _COLD_HOT / _COLD_INLINE), the hot methods'
inline limit + census (SHEPHERD_AOT_HOT_INLINE / _HOT_INLINE_LIMIT / SHEPHERD_AOT_INLINE_CENSUS). Applied AFTER vita/patches/k9-aot-compiler.patch,
k9-divfast-flag.patch and k9-divfast-compiler.patch by vita/toolchain/build-cross-k9.sh (SHEPHERD_K10_COMPILER=1). Every variable unset = the kit
#9 compiler's output, byte for byte.

--- a/src/mono/mono/mini/aot-compiler.c
+++ b/src/mono/mono/mini/aot-compiler.c
@@ -9699,9 +9699,621 @@
 	fprintf (k9_inst_out, "%s\n", key);
